          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 2,
           "html": "<strong>‘Little Martians &amp; Abraham’&nbsp;</strong>",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "video",
         "kind": "embed",
         "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/BBiUKCQsYLU?feature=oembed",
         "provider": "YouTube",
         "maxWidth": null,
         "poster": null,
         "title": "Little Martians & Abraham",
         "caption": "",
         "ratio": 56.49999999999999
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>This animation was exhibited with the original sculpture in the auction </strong><a href=\"https://onlineonly.christies.com/s/augmented-intelligence/vanessa-rosa-b-1990-31/250113?ldp_breadcrumb=back\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>‘Augmented Intelligence’</strong></a><strong> by Christie’s at the Rockefeller Center, from February 20th and March 5th 2025. It was sold as an </strong><a href=\"https://opensea.io/item/ethereum/0x9e3742bb02cb076242fc5f13b0869cef01db41b5/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>NFT</strong></a><strong> along the physical piece during the auction.</strong>",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>It was also exhibited in the </strong><a href=\"https://thecvf-art.com/project/little-martians-historian-of-consciousness/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>CVPR AI Art Gallery 2025</strong></a><strong> (online and during the conference), curated by Luba Elliot.</strong>",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>Finalist</strong>",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<a href=\"https://filmfreeway.com/aineuwavefilmfestival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Neu Wave AI film festival</a> | AI Short film | Los Angeles, USA | 2025",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>Semi-Finalist</strong>",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "AI Film Fest Serbia | AI Film | Belgrade, Serbia | 2025",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "<strong>Selected</strong>",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Experimenta Brasil | Best Experimental Film made with AI | Campos Dos Goytacazes, Brazil | 2025",
